# Technical Implementation

## Software Stack

*   **Frontend Framework:** React 18 + Vite + TypeScript - Fast, strictly typed UI client - Routing via `react-router-dom`
*   **UI Styling & Accents:** Tailwind CSS - Indigo: Citizen-facing screens - Teal: AI & Data processing - Rust: Decision engine views
*   **Voice Engine:** Web Speech API - Live, real-time voice-transcript preview - Multi-language support
*   **Storage & Auth:** Firebase JS SDK - Real-time Cloud Firestore integration - Native RTL layout support (Arabic & Persian)
*   **Backend Infrastructure:** Node.js 24 - Hosted seamlessly on Railway - Runs 3 long-lived continuous state watchers
*   **Mapping Infrastructure:** OpenStreetMap - Free geocoding using Nominatim - Facility query processing via Overpass API
*   **AI Core Services:** Google Gemini API - Gemini Flash (`gemini-3.6-flash`): Cleanup, translation, & JSON extraction - Gemini Embeddings (`gemini-embedding-001`): Semantic similarity matching

---

## Flow Chart Architecture

```mermaid
graph TD
    %% Base Palette Custom Color Configuration
    classDef bg fill:#3b3232,stroke:none,color:#ffffff;
    classDef client fill:#4338ca,stroke:#6366f1,stroke-width:2px,color:#ffffff;
    classDef ai fill:#0f766e,stroke:#14b8a6,stroke-width:2px,color:#ffffff;
    classDef backend fill:#9a3412,stroke:#ea580c,stroke-width:2px,color:#ffffff;
    classDef system fill:#4a3f3f,stroke:#cccccc,stroke-width:1px,color:#ffffff;

    %% Data Processing Flow Connections
    User([User <br> Citizen App]) ::: client -->|Voice Preview| WebSpeech[Web Speech API] ::: system
    WebSpeech -->|Live Preview| GeminiFlash[Gemini Flash <br> gemini-3.6-flash] ::: ai
    GeminiFlash -->|Transcript Cleanup <br> Language Detection <br> JSON Extraction| ReactVite[React 18 + Vite Client] ::: client

    ReactVite -->|Deploy Route| Hosting[Firebase Hosting <br> pledoc-app.web.app] ::: system
    ReactVite -->|Read / Write Data| Firestore[(Cloud Firestore <br> asia-south1)] ::: backend

    Railway[Node.js 24 Backend <br> Railway] ::: backend -->|functions/ watchers| Firestore
    Railway -->|Semantic Grouping| Embeddings[Gemini Embeddings <br> gemini-embedding-001] ::: ai
    Railway -->|Geocoding & Facility Data| OSM[OpenStreetMap <br> Nominatim & Overpass] ::: system

    %% Layout Container
    subgraph Architecture System ["Technical Architecture Matrix"]
        User; WebSpeech; GeminiFlash; ReactVite; Hosting; Firestore; Railway; Embeddings; OSM;
    end
    style Architecture System fill:#3b3232,stroke:#554848,color:#ffffff
```
